Why GPL-2.0-only, and why the "only" is load-bearing
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project imports piqtree, which declares GPL-2.0-only — without the "or any
later version" clause. A work combining GPL-2.0-only code cannot be relicensed
forward to GPL-3.0, so this project is GPL-2.0-only too. That is a consequence of
the dependency, not a preference: the sibling servers in this family are MIT and
GPL-3.0-or-later respectively, each set by what they link against.

